<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Williams Cos downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Williams Cos downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Friday analyst John Olson had cut his rating for Williams Cos Inc to intermediate-term neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Olson kept his rating on Williams Cos as a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Tulsa, Okla., natural gas pipeline company closed on Thursday at 44-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
